  "body": "This change aligns `window.opener` with WebKit, Chromium, Gecko, and the proposed https://github.com/whatwg/webidl/pull/1360.\n\n[`OrdinaryDefineOwnProperty`](https://tc39.es/ecma262/#sec-ordinarydefineownproperty) merely returns a boolean success result, which isn't an expected behaviour of a setter, and doesn't throw a `TypeError` in case of failure like web browsers do.\n\nUnlike `WindowProxy`, `Window`'s `[[DefineOwnProperty]]` method is ordinary, enabling us to use [`DefinePropertyOrThrow`](https://tc39.es/ecma262/#sec-definepropertyorthrow).\n\n<!--\nThank you for contributing to the HTML Standard! Please describe the change you are making and complete the checklist below if your change is not editorial.\n-->\n\n- [x] At least two implementers are interested (and none opposed):\n   * Implemented in WebKit since https://github.com/WebKit/WebKit/commit/1e336abec35481176bd436ef85e1e19bfd24057b.\n   * Implemented in Chromium since https://chromium.googlesource.com/chromium/src/+/5fbd649a655297f55356343f905f344423b4258b\n   * Gecko\n- [x] [Tests](https://github.com/web-platform-tests/wpt) are written and can be reviewed and commented upon at:\n   * https://github.com/web-platform-tests/wpt/blob/master/html/browsers/the-window-object/window-opener-unconfigurable.window.js\n\n(See [WHATWG Working Mode: Changes](https://whatwg.org/working-mode#changes) for more details.)\n\n\n<!--\n    This comment and the below content is programmatically generated.\n    You may add a comma-separated list of anchors you'd like a\n    direct link to below (e.g. #idl-serializers, #idl-sequence):\n\n    Don't remove this comment or modify anything below this line.\n    If you don't want a preview generated for this pull request,\n    just replace the whole of this comment's content by \"no preview\"\n    and remove what's below.\n-->\n***\n<a href=\"https://whatpr.org/html/9722/infrastructure.html\" title=\"Last updated on Sep 11, 2023, 5:27 AM UTC (326d325)\">/infrastructure.html</a>  ( <a href=\"https://whatpr.org/html/9722/c5af9c5...326d325/infrastructure.html\" title=\"Last updated on Sep 11, 2023, 5:27 AM UTC (326d325)\">diff</a> )\n<a href=\"https://whatpr.org/html/9722/nav-history-apis.html\" title=\"Last updated on Sep 11, 2023, 5:27 AM UTC (326d325)\">/nav-history-apis.html</a>  ( <a href=\"https://whatpr.org/html/9722/c5af9c5...326d325/nav-history-apis.html\" title=\"Last updated on Sep 11, 2023, 5:27 AM UTC (326d325)\">diff</a> )",
